  "description": "\u00c7ay\u00f6n\u00fc was a Neolithic settlement located in southern Turkey. Its remains date ca. 7200 to 6600 BC. The site spans the entire Pre-pottery Neolithic sequence and recent investigations suggest that \u00c7ay\u00f6n\u00fc may be the site of the first domestication of the pig (Sus scrofa).",
